WEBVTT

00:00.160 --> 00:03.120
Will the tree you plant today survive on your land?

00:03.120 --> 00:05.200
With RootRite, just drop a pin.

00:05.200 --> 00:09.040
It reads the elevation, rainfall, soil and slope.

00:09.280 --> 00:13.280
Then it ranks the native trees that fit your site best.

00:13.840 --> 00:15.200
Have a tree in mind?

00:15.360 --> 00:19.920
It tells you straight away and shows native trees to plant instead.

00:20.800 --> 00:26.000
Your planting plan shows how many seedlings to buy and how to space them.

00:26.320 --> 00:31.200
Ten years of rain records show the best months to plant.

00:31.440 --> 00:35.280
And the map shows where to ask for seedlings near you.

00:36.400 --> 00:38.480
Now take a photo of your site.

00:38.480 --> 00:47.680
AI Site Scan reads the soil, slope, light and moisture, then shows you the before and after.

00:47.680 --> 00:50.080
So plant the right tree in the right place.

00:50.080 --> 00:52.080
That's RootRite.
